  {"id": "vo.kare", "lesson": "le.l16", "lesson_order": 26, "surface": "彼", "kana": "かれ", "zh": ["他", "男朋友"], "pos": "pron", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "examples": ["se.l16.023", "se.l16.045", "se.l17.047"], "trap_zh": "也有「男朋友」的意思。對長輩或上司不用 {ja:彼|かれ} 稱呼。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kanojo", "lesson": "le.l16", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "彼女", "kana": "かのじょ", "zh": ["她", "女朋友"], "pos": "pron", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "examples": ["se.l16.046", "se.l16.052"], "trap_zh": "也有「女朋友」的意思。對長輩或上司不用 {ja:彼女|かのじょ} 稱呼。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.otona", "lesson": "le.l19", "lesson_order": 4, "surface": "大人", "kana": "おとな", "zh": ["大人", "成人"], "pos": "n", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["people"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l19.034", "se.l19.035"], "trap_zh": "讀音是特殊讀法 {ja:おとな}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.boku", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 9, "surface": "僕", "kana": "ぼく", "zh": ["我（男性）"], "pos": "pron", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "examples": ["se.l21.016", "se.l21.017", "se.l22.050", "se.l22.059"], "trap_zh": "男性自稱，語氣比 {ja:私|わたし} 親近。女性一般不用，但歌詞裡女性歌手也常用 {ja:僕|ぼく}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ore", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 10, "surface": "俺", "kana": "おれ", "zh": ["我（男性，粗獷）"], "pos": "pron", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["people"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.019", "se.l21.018", "se.l22.060", "se.l24.066"], "trap_zh": "只在熟悉的朋友間用，對長輩或正式場合不能用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kimi", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 11, "surface": "君", "kana": "きみ", "zh": ["你（親近）"], "pos": "pron", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.020", "se.l22.061", "se.l23.043"], "trap_zh": "主要是男性對朋友或晚輩用；對長輩不能用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.chan", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 12, "surface": "ちゃん", "kana": "ちゃん", "zh": ["接在名字後的親暱稱呼"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "examples": ["se.l21.022", "se.l21.021", "se.l22.063", "se.l24.067"], "trap_zh": "多用於小孩或很熟的朋友，不用於自己，對長輩也不用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kun", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 13, "surface": "くん", "kana": "くん", "zh": ["接在男生名字後的稱呼"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["people"], "examples": ["se.l21.006", "se.l21.023", "se.l22.057"], "trap_zh": "多用於男同學或晚輩，不用於自己，對長輩也不用。", "notes": []},
